tol-palettes: third-party notices
================================

This project is independent. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Paul Tol.
The name "Paul Tol" is used only to describe the source of the colour values.

Policy: this project stores colour VALUES only, with attribution. It does not
copy the notes' prose, figures, the PDF or the LaTeX template.

Sources
-------
1. Paul Tol's notes, "Colour schemes and templates"
   https://sronpersonalpages.nl/~pault/
2. tol_colors.py (version 2022.10)
   https://sronpersonalpages.nl/~pault/data/tol_colors.py
   Its header reads: "Copyright (c) 2022, Paul Tol. All rights reserved.
   License: Standard 3-clause BSD". The header names the licence but does not
   reproduce its text, so the standard 3-clause BSD text is reproduced below.
3. Colour schemes and templates (PDF)
   https://sronpersonalpages.nl/~pault/data/colourschemes.pdf

Which values come from where is recorded per scheme in data/schemes/*.json
(the "source" field). Values that also appear in tol_colors.py are covered by
the notice below. Values that appear only on the notes page (for example dark,
pale, incandescent, banded and groundcover) are published as plain colour
values with attribution to the notes page; their terms have not been
confirmed with the author.

